  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The woman's smile is mapped as a performative smile",
  "description": "The top text 'hello is that everything you need?' initiates a service interaction, while the bottom text 'i thought you left your smile back there' sarcastically implies that the woman's smile is not genuine. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity 'woman' (specifically her smile) is mapped onto the textual concept of a 'performative smile' — a smile that is expected but not authentic. The text overlays project the interpretation of her smile as a social performance onto the visual material, aligning with the misogynous stereotype that women in service roles must perform cheerfulness.",
